1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:04,976
If the app is free, you are the product.
There are three prices.

2
00:00:05,946 --> 00:00:07,502
None of them are money.

3
00:00:09,053 --> 00:00:14,773
Ads you cannot skip. Data you cannot see.
Features you cannot remove.

4
00:00:15,743 --> 00:00:19,656
Features you cannot remove, unless you pay
monthly.

5
00:00:21,206 --> 00:00:26,296
Fifty percent of the revenue is
advertising. Thirty is data.

6
00:00:27,266 --> 00:00:28,754
The rest is storage.

7
00:00:29,724 --> 00:00:31,157
Twenty is storage.

8
00:00:32,707 --> 00:00:37,310
Twelve hours a year, watching ads in an
app you did not choose.

9
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:39,719
That is a working day.

10
00:00:41,269 --> 00:00:46,113
Free with ads, or paid without. There is
no third option.

11
00:00:47,663 --> 00:00:52,159
Pay once for the tool you use daily. Pay
forever for the rest.

12
00:00:53,709 --> 00:00:58,000
Ads, data, features. That is what free
means.

13
00:00:59,550 --> 00:01:04,056
Pay for the one thing you use every day.
Not the five you might.
